1. Trigger: When a row is added, modified, or deleted
Entity: opportunity
Filter: isdocument eq true
Type: OpenApiConnectionWebhook
2. varOppId: Initialize Variable
Name: varOppId (String)
Type: string
Value:
triggerOutputs()?['body/_objectid_value']
3. varFileName: Initialize Variable
Name: varFileName
Type: string
Value:
triggerOutputs()?['body/filename']
4. Compose
Inputs:
base64ToBinary(triggerOutputs()?['body/documentbody'])
5. varTargetFolderName: Initialize Variable
Name: varTargetFolderName
Type: string
Value:
concat( outputs('Get_a_row_by_ID')?['body/name'], '', variables('varOppId') )
6. Condition
Expression:
equals( @triggerOutputs()?['body/_objectid_value@Microsoft.Dynamics.CRM.lookuplogicalname'], 'opportunity' )
If Yes:
Get_a_row_by_ID

entityName: opportunities
recordId:
@variables('varOppId (String)')
Set_variable

Name: varTargetFolderName
Value:
concat( outputs('Get_a_row_by_ID')?['body/name'], '', variables('varOppId') )
